T o be eligible for inclusion in a GA benefit group, if otherwise eligible, an individual must be:

A. a citizen of the United States;

B. a naturalized citizen;

C. an alien who entered the United States before August 22, 1996, and who meets the definition of a qualified immigrant at 8.106.100 NMAC or meets the definition of a PRUCOL; or

D. an alien who entered the United States on or after August 22, 1996, and who meets the definition of a qualified alien at 8.106.100 NMAC.

